  "description": "Core library of the NewLife framework: logging (file/network), configuration (XML/JSON/HTTP), cache (memory/distributed), networking (TCP/UDP/HTTP/WebSocket), serialization (binary/XML/JSON), APM tracing, IoC container, actor model, timer scheduler and plugin framework. NativeAOT-ready, with built-in runtime localization; targets 11 frameworks from .NET Framework 4.5 to .NET 10.0. 核心组件库：日志、配置、缓存、网络、序列化、APM 性能追踪、对象容器、并行模型、定时调度与插件框架；原生 AOT 就绪，内置运行时多语言消息；单包覆盖 .NET Framework 4.5 至 .NET 10.0 共 11 个目标框架。",
  "iconFile": "leaf.png",
